      \operatorname{IndL}_{\mathcal{N}}(\Omega_{\mathcal{X}})_{\frac{1}{2}} \subset \operatorname{IndL}(\Omega_{\mathcal{X}})_{\frac{1}{2}}
\end{align*}
are exactly those having supports $0\in \mathfrak{g}/\!\!/ G$ with respect
