    \mu(d_1)>\cdots> \mu(d_k) \right\rangle. 
\end{align*}
Here the right-hand side is after all the decompositions $d=d_1+\cdots+d_k$, and 
$\delta_i\in M(d_i)^{W_i}_{\mathbb{R}}$ is determined by 
