 For the notation of the right-hand side, see Subsection~\ref{subsec:Koszuleq}.

Similarly, we also have the equivalence 
\begin{align*}
	\Psi_{\circ} \colon \operatorname{Coh}(\mathcal{U}_{\circ}) \stackrel{\sim}{\to}
	\mathrm{MF}^{\mathrm{gr}}((\mathcal{V}^L)^{\vee} \setminus (\pi^L)^{-1}(\mathcal{S}^L), f). 
