	=
	\mathrm{MF}^{\mathrm{gr}}((\mathcal{V}^L)^{\vee}_{\circ}, f)
	\end{align*}
since any matrix factorization is supported on the critical locus $\mathrm{Crit}(f)$, 
see~\cite[Corollary~3.18]{MR3112502}. 
Therefore we have the equivalence 
\begin{align*}
	\Psi_{\circ} \colon \operatorname{Coh}(\mathcal{U}_{\circ}) \stackrel{\sim}{\to}
