}
	\end{align}
Here $j_{\mathcal{V}} \colon (\mathcal{V}^L)^{\vee}_{\circ} \hookrightarrow (\mathcal{V}^L)^{\vee}$ is the open 
immersion. By Proposition~\ref{prop:sod:V} and applying it to matrix factorizations for the functions in (\ref{dia:SV}), the right vertical arrow 
admits a fully-faithful left adjoint 
\begin{align*}
