For a fixed $(r, w)$, there is a left action of $\mathbb{H}$ on 
\begin{align*}
\bigoplus_{\chi \in \mathbb{Z}}\operatorname{L}(\mathrm{Higgs}_{\operatorname{GL}_r}(\chi))_w \left(=  \bigoplus_{\chi \in \mathbb{Z}}\mathbb{T}_{\mathrm{GL}_r}(\chi)_w \mbox{ if }(r, w) \mbox{ are coprime}\right).
